{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1575,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c4ba574bfd4b9f05734c7f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "荣光星期日的主角是无声铃鹿！\n从第四弯道起点就已经分出胜负\n她成功取得了盾之荣誉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c47873d3d1b31236ba9ec1bd93b9b14b244828145aed7c1d21463a3e801f5e2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f623d5a24eef8bc4e66fa7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征所达成的无败皋月赏制霸！\n东海帝王也抵达了那个轨迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9bfe229b632954f23d7874728feced4d13d2aa25c2c07b089774d2d6b8c1564",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3991030144b80e37d36734aa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基领先！\n这差距或许连缩小一丝都做不到！\n丸善斯基，太强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6bd7676d07316b2df240b055f76c89983e86a4eb7e9789a141bf5690899a3e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71984c7bcbca8f7b959679ce",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "小栗第一名！　小栗第一名！\n精彩地回应了粉丝们的欢呼声！\n她就是超级赛马娘，她就是小栗帽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7867335685a5b03226e60b1034b152f0945bdbc80b4d1bd846f2da074bbef3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2dfb5881d7a0d3b8933a7a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "黄金船！\n继皋月和菊花之后，在大奖赛中\n也精彩地揽下了金牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b771e4434035fa3887130e39ca0bfc28deb456c1a9135ae224639e14eb85f60",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1f9e51750c8209807631ec",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "伏特加领先！　终于实现了德比赛马娘的梦想！\n伏特加精彩地将其化作现实！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1782c441493c45a946477d43596deb9888137a0b49c5ac982f8e4426235e9e36",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6103d92e484b4f5e0dc7b0a9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是大和赤骥！\n梦想之门现在敞开！　从三后冠路线开始\n毫无疑问的大奖赛制霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c6a625539f53c1f7be61a8b77bb3bf5ac5d9db81f7e61d15d6a1ee076c1e8ed",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f34392ffa629fbce61231b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "大树快车好强！　毫无疑问是大树快车！\n压倒性的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e191819d923bf63b70f3f8fbf9779b3df94bcb89e88d00dd4c8b37fcb4ed7e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b46fbb170cd56b26bd09f28",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "强者果然就是强者！\n尽管特别周很强，\n但草上飞更胜一筹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "916c261df77d6dfa34a7c8883abf308c8e601c9838ced740955a2ca86e977897",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc511cbad782eacb6641cbe",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "麦昆！是麦昆！！\n是目白，但却是麦昆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "828a489c49fc667211418fb14bc4ebfeb3280f8168aa94e49d951665bc8aba45",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:becf56f953da2926cf2eb857",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "神鹰！\n即便在府中2400m赛道也展现了她的强大\n成功击败了所有劲敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd175365892cd0ee8dd8aa53e8d725aee870668b468bf712dc50fbd9de245a0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e6068e2c3860d86219f4e32",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "大轮之花在这微阴的京都竞马场盛开了！\n我国的赛马娘史上将镌刻下她的名字\n经典三冠达成了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee11580dba20c0adebd896e131d5792027be2e27cf008fe211cfddef035c62bd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dcc7d131f717ed2e2252079",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "气槽！　真是可怕的赛马娘！\n女帝令众多强敌为之臣服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a75cb3ce179b7672c24f67b0ce97c8ca20ce4a5ff4967a70728b7cd80d71f908",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58349f7359a9c593f025101c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是摩耶重炮～！\n她终于在这菊之舞台上胜出了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d6f5053eed4dbd00f03dade5fcc4fd54575b58ecdfcadb2c78acdaff0d42f0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f2ca815f72490a481082db3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩在这距离上绝不会输！\n宝冢的主角是目白赖恩！\n宝冢的主角是目白赖恩！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e3bb9df43e8848b423cad279482c795caaa250c8fd3716130130bf0cf53014",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93094c9230ce3f5a26d84779",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "米浴！　她跨越了淀之坡\n成功在这梦之宝冢纪念制胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "679d3e8c8e1d49c331614b0c11c955780246b827ea26dc05819d17392aab6df1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac24a665fbd0f055e4955546",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "中山2000m，道路首先开始连接！\n爱丽速子首先拿下一冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa9b639679584f83bb5cb27b441dea57fa9667442e99d132f69271feccd0440",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a57d510307247afb76c1c2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "夙愿的德比制霸！\n胜利奖券将其实现了！\n拿下日本德比的是胜利奖券！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b4e1047618b3d7867ff5ad87b15b498f9acb65a02a3678ee9b243cf3fb8aecc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3e37d451a72c8728de78279",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "樱花进王拿下GⅠ！\n樱花进王高举右手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5108fc371b177981546e6e9d2adf1f38d65c47877c08b28fbcb04f71a8dc840",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af061467d12f42f7aba4976",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "小栗帽没能赶上！\n拦在小栗帽面前的超级溪流\n达成了天皇赏春秋连霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "230a8ee7b099a550054918a10ca3330e33cd8f87a4939c1094ded7b932ed2f32",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3feb3ab8284e3850229624cc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "春丽加油！　春丽加油！\n我们终于见证了春丽的第一场胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3afee2e89b5570be9557af8674ed51fab7aa65c8fb84ed4950df427011426e1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c19908cd1f38a1c6f44b8b7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "继京都之后制胜神户！\n神户赛场之福也到来了！\n胜者是待兼福来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0a752adff4a7083fc77679e8caba6da842a79ca03065a2e2ec2f478b6ad0fa",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:546572d88ba1cad0bc9a727b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "优秀素质，是优秀素质！\n一直没能拿下GⅠ的优秀素质，\n在这场有马纪念中大放异彩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e97a9fad079d82e9e569887e822fd53e7855b836f98b7411dc7e8800ae3c4f55",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f84a0171d33771c57ec8204",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "圣王光环斩断一切败绩！\n惊人的末脚！　她终于拿下GⅠ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f95a79a9dbdf354dfbdc84b1b03c7b8dfa6f097789a7ea19e4e72b5fa76c0d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a8ed3fdc6058ce3a0630427",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "好歌剧！\n即便在在盾之舞台之后的大奖赛舞台上\n那高声歌唱者仍是歌剧王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93755fd0ff6d1318721a7b8c40c12de738380bd6e3394532adc75fd1aee55a28",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b447bcf774904999befe9c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "秋菊近在身　越过仁川之丘山　长旅行一人\n正是美浦波旁所及之处",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42003db71eec41afdf02ea0578a59e63f0ca17612d3ee1cc397834f785edf8b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:529aa4382401896045db10fb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光在宝冢纪念取得压倒性胜利！\n今天的她也是一脸平静\n轻松冲线的是琵琶晨光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1bc1f1896b2fe25523a90106e163b63ccb1fc98beffde1a3fda22483479f1cc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30c14f63ab0b874fc295fba5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "真机伶！　是真机伶！\n她在这中山赛场上终于夺下了GⅠ头衔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6bda5ec09514112c010ea523bf80b94c6a12f2716b903c7bd40d53c98f8b683",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f25ef3b0811cd5c9dde1c1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "看来成田大进成功反超了！\n成田大进以惊人的脚力拿下了皋月赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6689c1df65ecaa5663e1dd8932968e1688f98d62b8d944f42946971f696a727a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a027376fe3b454f130b8b738",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰正在领放！\n这场比赛果然是醒目飞鹰的独角戏吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf01a9fa043b6d532f8ad6bdc9b6b7c9779048adcbdde9a987daf94ed0aa99f7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43e11beb4948d3172493b8d3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "白仁已不惧阴影！　白仁已不惧阴影！\n面向大决战，她一马当先，领放到底！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5302d9bac24847e76eb9df18e2bc087bcfb8906392810e40dd57a269934ce2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f00c1ee0364cb0340e603e85",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "青云天空一放到底了！\n她正如今日京都竞马场的上空一样！\n京都竞马场，今天是万里的青空！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5f371ea04b6522ee90f443abd2af35e1020dd47d1af753c4c295e3b5415c950",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ea4e01d1041e84fa2ab1d6d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊从外道一口气冲了上来！\n菱亚马逊以惊人的脚力紧追不放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe62b805d09677afa6cd5a17cc30d7c7058870dbbc1cd23f9fb22446802d97b6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310ee72898c02d116752d996",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "富士奇石要被追上了吗！　但她毫不退让！\n但她绝不放弃！　这才叫强大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba709fb55ee28bc714232adfe03ae1b3e9dfea1a7c8dae138a6809dbd52e6722",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c240062f555aafadbae49b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "金发随风飘舞，黄金城市是第一名！\n这位百年一遇的美少女赛马娘\n用双腿证明了自己的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb9f0cee48b35b2060afbf9506cbdec9709852637bb7f776bcfc14b02e8308f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95bb91b39dd7486f0f10f20f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "怒涛领先！　怒涛领先！\n名将怒涛的执念在这里会起作用吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a867fb94c9d8623cf962d5e5cf153e464a0fa80b723b4968d4e930c5d7b355",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac0f5b3f654fd3e4c3d84458",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "德比赛马娘荣进闪耀！\n她又一次在府中赛场光辉闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba34ff583efa3fd4e94fa33448a66d004c08fb559a3f03aa5715f657a4ebe30f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a0e54959dc8fd141cda8f1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "甩开众多刺客，在最前方\n冲过终点线的是菱曙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4777beb19b0412c8d5013c1868ad5fc6f0e341702518b8c0caa644a6be0b1cf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:721059d1e5adaa7dd60cab36",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在日本国英国国旗的见证之下，\n在淀边赛场上赢得伊丽莎白女王杯的会是谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2b0f8df9b511b17f311eb0357fb2e7cae8ea1bd79c5446ac52dafd4c649d2e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5574335a6c86400d1b00731b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "真是令人信服的强大，爱丽数码！\n在草地2000m战斗中也精彩地拿下了GⅠ的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2522a4ec3831870d593f7cf89a12b6ce4817f591d874123d4cce39bd2bd72d0f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47f3bcdc3a03b4dc54c772c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第一名是川上公主！\n无败的橡树大赛赛马娘此刻诞生！\n川上公主干得漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71dfdb0de7e84e9904115fac43100282495d3f93ad2ea27c25855004e1dce58a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:847ee2ae666a3436ccfc9291",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "从外道冲来的是曼城茶座！\n从外道冲来的是曼城茶座！\n其他马娘完全无法与之匹敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7990f9da416b6dfdfdb83c2b94dba076054a666ce86260abc02de17c3a48c719",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a99495fb135b2ecef7196e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦获胜！　我们见识到了她的毅力！\n首次拿下GⅠ头衔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5c7dfff9b99d073a335e40b3c78fd99b13c04f990e15e12a97ef1ef64bd9695",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd54122957339ab1ac3a8717",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "无论如何也要实现经典赛之梦！\n多伯，干得漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "881325f72c5e66d25a87dfe5c94fa8151111b0d12ea66fc2ca80d446ad05a3fc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ed4aaec2c55b33d0b4d45c9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势！　无败的秋之女王诞生了！\n同世代中几乎已无人能敌！\n她有着无限的可能性！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1f603ea9bebaa416170cdb06b9dd3a4d518b6c44e39cd6562afffae8ddbf6fc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52cbbf7f7f9c9a67b6c98073",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "玉藻十字！　是玉藻十字！\n古马的气魄！她击败了经典级的期待股\n达成天皇赏春秋连霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b0444f43c520f61a7cd46da3f7f959d8572ff4aa711c7671430c296ae4708",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a22003263fdc863456a9e526",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王沿着外道冲了上来！\n樱花千代王冲到了领先位置！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78eca6f1cb4c9c4f758326705e64199e38bae953a69c3aee77f9c9ab586a009b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ed2fccdd01fae13d2797b6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹拼尽全力夺得领先！\n目白阿尔丹领先！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d467c1eff2b4c6968df9c62d1e80783645b0ac543e30c88b51eb4e91d26f98c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40713a54273651558d7fd696",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "制霸日本德比，\\n闪耀着一等星光辉的是爱慕织姬！\n果然赢得这场决战的是爱慕织姬！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cd3bb036dcbc6f138212cd628f0ceabc3849eb19731a302edda9856b6711d7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0316bef7a0b111945a6cb434",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太久没有见过这种程度的比赛了！\n实在是惊人！\n从外道追上来的是待兼诗歌剧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10764749c5803ce362cf472adbf19c9b92eda959b6d9030c377b3f4a28e92d71",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a9a77889d997065e57f879",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "请听听这掌声！请听听这欢呼声！\n这是今年最后的北黑祭典！\n她堂堂正正地在有马纪念领放制胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf7cdda2dad28ba9f5cb614dd57909d6d772defdc5c6082fd9098e7bee670c4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811a05eeb58637b96bf4e2da",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这一冠绝不退让，里见光钻！\n在这微阴的京都竞马场上\n钻石终于闪耀了光辉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb4a41a614e237015c206fa94d2ee6651e8ee2df8fafa8791921177ec9568caa",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a1071005026f08ecdfce77",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "光明，是光明！\n她为目白家带来了春之盾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f9fe1b883a30f4e303c16484d53e293611a779ad26926c9638ebe1ac7d993c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbd6543ee0bee318867c63c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "西野花！\\n用保持前列的战术在直线脱颖而出\\n成功制霸樱花赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b40ff530a5d213209c6af8e4f6d6cf63acfcb37f13c09e9e8c7101fa0fb1ab",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e97f7ccbc022e08695b8f401",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "成功制霸皋月赏，这府中的2000m赛场上，\\n八重无敌再次起舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90b98914325b522a1474ba027fd7e28838ddceed4ec1b13805371499dc49eef8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5c5c6ceb46f8e2676b0572d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神！　这场比赛绝不会输！\\n她为皋月赏一雪前耻\\n在这场日本德比成功取胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff1cfd86e7c9367a1f3c6e0fd0e02580d29bbc09a1c1a20d2bdbb5b31c68b400",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea2dc178e168cf7e4021927b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "是善信是善信！　善信一放到底！\\n目白善信全程领放\\n成功制霸大奖赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f704513ce4333a4891f1aff5fa52c7f0da1622329f5ced029e87e313a7d8d15",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52dab333c50904aa41d34630",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "稻荷一从内侧冲上来了！\\n稻荷一从内侧冲上来了！\\n稻荷一夺得了领先而且还在扩大差距！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e36b570b979726c5f5eafa153fd9cfcdae70b8b9ec67892bdf82d4a04931343",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cc9f76293507d26a1875276",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第1名东商变革！　成功赶超制胜！\\n这位赛马娘的实力货真价实！　今天的胜利由她收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e703aaa964e64f52a804c0e35d71124ed6cc1b9a2571555374599735307bcf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5a52791945750171eea08f2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "三冠之路要从皋月赏开始！\\n干得漂亮！　空中神宫夺冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "508e3c1d133497c26ae909d1b906bddc193310832482ed58391965835a75c8f0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d77cb4c3bd37b5193dd8c5b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念，你我的梦想都将在此奔跑。\n我的梦想，就是青竹回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b45876b6c1e4064842b99a67d762a33ee821768fe2108064595d4ca32344bae",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:955ebb45f067b7041399e300",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "春之霸者在秋季依旧实力强劲！\\n小林历奇，称霸JBC经典赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d954cf1a0c5477f0b1a33513a5ff824271738e036fec52860b0dfe27b10124df",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe0f3550702a6c081ddb86d0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "雪之美人！\\n这就是顽强的陆奥精神！这就是不屈的陆奥精神！\\n雪之美人的实力之强已毫无争议！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24d80dd946df43f709ebe9ebe5b71115b1ab45778429ed78b3f9d50ed4940589",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c0c2492b0bd14aa420918f9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "是采珠的胜利！\\n这是毋庸置疑的名马娘之道！　毋庸置疑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37a7779a95d57115441c1bb133d5fd8d81a2ca4dc5cc88141630996c3fad3af7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3447a4781f1cef391e456e4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是真弓快车！\\n出色的领放！\\n漂亮地赢下了短途马锦标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2275950588f64b921e259386b3cecee898ec72e86dfb2b4f8e0027472bfd7c3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46ed4bd0eed26ec91eec142c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉安田纪念连霸！\\n她最终的冲刺极为强悍\\n也文摄辉获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d604a6204b9f7d8f3ccd378284ec4a9ab500a2e786f5bc974bee23f68f911319",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7c955e9bd50712d64406c3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "中山庆典，惊人的表现！\\n是未曾亮出过底牌的中山庆典！\\n制霸宝冢纪念！　场内一片哗然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73ca67739f52297810880c6b6100fb56a08d8faa7f772a40c580d2a6ba93e2d1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f55e5d2179ebea22aeb206b0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "外道的是奇锐骏！\\n奇锐骏！\\n奇锐骏冲出来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9315d98ae8b6fd84fd522d09671739fa31c8863e2c26327b0fec024e025da0a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d3a8903e917525f9cb5f17",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是荒漠英雄！\\n接二连三的GⅠ挑战后她第一次获得了荣誉！\\n获得了天皇赏秋之盾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f23fea8f82d3fc96ef14929c97e846f0139216cff259d640a937ddc598ee7126",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d95fd3250f20a17406e45831",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "今年这条赛道上最闪耀的是北港火山！\\n称霸了年终最重大的东京大赏典！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c55625180fa3d1558db512b603c66db2db8426e3651b66831a5cbdc5ab9bcc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91eeefb5c17cd67e5d98e077",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "大拓紧接着去年取得连胜！\\n大拓紧接着去年取得连胜！\\n大拓太阳神举起右手，那是她的胜利姿势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b312c4f2a8191afca4e7823a8628fbeaa85b8815aaf925045e4836b98a39c4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d9d9598e4f261bb689f699",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "府中的沙土之王，新光风！\\n她的模样足以称得上王者的雄姿，\\n此时正在东京竞马场高唱凯歌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6154587f28fb7aee356bc45f6e5c9338de6dc81cdf64e72d90d305a4f759c88d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd9db5b713e6cbead0a0716",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "千明代表现在领先！\\n是连大地都为之震撼的千明代表！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40332c078bfaae27eeba9ce1786fde199d2b5ec9bbd4014a70fb5d587481e090",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884d5f11c4e8ad68e5c989e8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "双涡轮咆哮！\\n她以全开的涡轮发动机成功逃脱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6cac87e775f4ae421e32e3ec96daa38b63a520dd9bb858a292ea41994eeb237",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed989c66f22383120a36da1c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是第一红宝石！\\n华丽一族的继承者第一红宝石！\\n首次制霸了GⅠ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7642c149f9e29f7df2bf65b47636277d90c45275d5b7289dd2b6b7e9afb3449a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa650ed6c05de4aa3c64cec6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是吉兆！\\n打破常识的古马级挑战中，赢得了GⅠ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "805c1cee7095bd2cc51597f516a523300573780c742f7c8768f4870c9d58438b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4332b63456e73280971ea2dd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "突围的是樱花桂冠！\\n她在大奖赛史上第一次刻上了\\n樱花之名！　是樱花桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aebacc68940eb4dcf6b51d9c2a97876366eccc93bdb8559d64c6490e96002368",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a6c0978a06a8409ca6d1cc7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "完美取得皋月赏・德比两冠！\\n她在多云天气下的东京竞马场完成了这项壮举！\\n是新宇宙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3b7809ad21b007422a344b40c9d75bb9a97aad2780a6c72ed5df6bd7fa2bf3f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01616c64c61d742201e55134",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "再一次出现了奇迹～，阪神竞马场！\\n能拿下天皇赏菊花赏绝非徒有虚名！\\n获胜的是天皇赏、菊花赏赛马娘菱钻奇宝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27343686e6e3c17f523a3ba0145a12db7d7894a5542bee82828c178dbc4b4f04",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89d36a97352eba2ccb1d89e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒果然强大！\\n这次是、这次是、这次终于是炸裂的末脚～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52cbf28ce372bf0a24c22ca7caa8c2217cebc50edb1a68e78237471b09b07570",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4140"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
